UPDATE intakedastaging
SET jsondata = jsonb_set(jsondata, '{General}',
jsonb_set(jsondata->'General', '{Narrative}', '"<p>Caller stated that this call has been in the making for many years, with the latest episode being the Mom (Denisha Burden) was evicted with eldest daughter (\"Yolanda\" Haigler) and two younger boys Daryans Haigler (10 yo?) and Dashauns Haigler (6yo?). Instead of going with the kids, the oldest daughter called family member (Dionte Burden, great uncle) to seek help and help came. Mom left the children with the family member and left to go to Atlantic city with live in girlfriend that she calls her wife. This happened around December 15<sup>th</sup>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The family has been evicted 10-15 times over a number of years. Caller reports that the living environment is unsettling as Denisha has people that she meets online and moves them in, which has happened multiple times. One of them was a felon. Yolanda constantly left with younger siblings as mom would leave town and go out at night or leave for weekend. When Yolanda left for college then Deonte Haigler (oldest son, 17yo) was left with this responsibility. Longest standing residences were Days Inn and EconoLodge in Easton, MD but the family has been evicted from both hotels. Deonte told the caller that there is lack of food and also reported that there has not been help provided for his learning disability. Mom and her various girlfriends have mocked Deonte. Mom has called him ”stupid, dummy and often belittled him”. The caller reported that the most recent frightening episode was he had an argument with mom’s current girlfriend that the kids call her wife, and the mother said “don’t you ever disrespect my wife, if you ever do that again I will kill you.” Deonte said to the caller I cannot believe that someone who birthed me would threaten to kill me over someone who is not even her blood.</p><p>Mom is currently not caring for the children and is currently still in Atlantic City. Deonte is currently living with the children''s great grandmother Joan Frederick (12/06/45) and Yolanda, Daryans and Dashauns are currently living with Dionte Burden in Baltimore, MD.</p><p><br></p><p>The caller reported that the children''s living environment prior to eviction was living in a one room hotel room with two beds, the 3 boys, mom and moms girlfriend all shared this room. Before Yolanda went to college she also stayed in this room.</p><p>The caller reported that Deonte stated that Mom and Girlfriend are having sex in the same room with the kids while they are in the room the to the point where Deonte said he would wake up and have to train himself to sleep on one side so that he would not have to see that. Sometimes he would sleep on the floor and the other boys on the bed and they would switch. Deonte would put his headphones on and go in the bathroom so he did not hear them having sex. Deonte did not want to say but eventually shared that the 10yo was filming his mother having sex with mom’s phone. Deonte shared that while mom is sleep the 10yo then starts touching his mom and filming that as well. The caller could not specify where the 10y was touching mom. Mom showed Deonte the video when she saw it on her phone and her consequence was to put him on the side of the room that she does not sleep on.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The children are not currently receiving therapy and miss a lot of school but the caller was not sure what school they go to. A couple incidents witnessed by the hotel, one in which the mother put the two eldest out and great grandmother had to pick them up at 2am. Hotel called the great grandmother. Deonte returned after a few months because the wife allegedly left and he wanted to go back to school. Mom put him out again and he was walking the road with inadequate clothing either no pants or no shirt, caller cannot remember, and great grandmother picked him up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Great grandmother and great uncle have had to provide financial support at times as well. Mom has been harassing great grandmother with calls saying that she is going to call the police and say that great grandmother kidnapped her kids.</p><p>He would like updates on what happened, worried that the 10yo is not getting proper help.</p><p><br></p><p>*Deontie is currently residing with Great-Greandmother Joan Frederick at 5217 Sunflower Ln. Linkwood, MD 21835, Joan''s phone number is 410-330-4316</p><p>Rykeisha (yolanda), Daryan, and Dashaun are all residing with Dionte Burden at 913 Pennsylvania Ave. Apt 3A  Baltimore, MD 21201</p><p><br></p><p>Caller would like to be first point of contact for information regarding the children as he states that he can give a more accurate history.</p> <p>Upon review, this incident occurred in Talbot County. A duplicate intake was created and assigned for a CPS response in Talbot County. Please refer to Intake Referral # I231011843523 and CPS-IR# 231021697147 for additional information about the Department''s response.</p>"'))
WHERE intakenumber = 'I231011831088' AND activeflag=1;

